sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant HTTP as HTTP server
    participant Metrics as Metrics/logger
    participant SQLite

    Client->>HTTP: GET /ready
    HTTP->>Metrics: Generate request ID and start timer
    HTTP->>SQLite: SELECT 1
    SQLite-->>HTTP: Successful probe
    HTTP->>Metrics: Record counter and duration
    HTTP-->>Client: 200 {status: ready}

    Note over Client,SQLite: Document ingestion and search are added only with real backing functionality.
